    {
      "selector": ".sqs-html-content (index 0)",
      "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><div class=\"sqsrte-scaled-text-container\"><span class=\"sqsrte-scaled-text\"><p class=\"\" style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">The Oceans</span></p></span></div></div>",
      "text": "The Oceans"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".sqs-html-content (index 1)",
      "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\"><strong>The Oceans:</strong> The Oceans is inspired by our vast seas and its mysteries. While water covers 70% of our planet, over 80% of it has been left unexplored. Our science has gotten us to the surface of Mars and the moon, yet we know less about the alien-like environment of our oceans. This work is a dedication to the beauty of our deep blue seas, all of its beaches, its life forms and its quirks. Without our waters, our home would scorch from the sun's energy. The oceans absorb massive amounts of heat without increasing the overall climate of our planet. That in itself, is worth protecting.</span></p></div>",
      "text": "The Oceans: The Oceans is inspired by our vast seas and its mysteries. While water covers 70% of our planet, over 80% of it has been left unexplored. Our science has gotten us to the surface of Mars and the moon, yet we know less about the alien-like environment of our oceans. This work is a dedication to the beauty of our deep blue seas, all of its beaches, its life forms and its quirks. Without our waters, our home would scorch from the sun's energy. The oceans absorb massive amounts of heat without increasing the overall climate of our planet. That in itself, is worth protecting."
    },
